Upstream: open issue pdeljanov/Symphonia#582 (by nicolasfalesy, 2026-10-09) reaches the same seek_buffered assert through a negative trun data offset; open PR #610 (by hsdfat, 2026-11-07) rejects that offset before seeking but leaves seek_buffered unchanged.
Our trigger is a >2 GiB stco delta on 32-bit, so #610 alone does not cover it.

